<title>USA: San Francisco $131 mln bonds won by JP Morgan.</title>
<headline>San Francisco $131 mln bonds won by JP Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said Tuesday it won $131.3 million Public Utilities Commission of the City and County of San Francisco, Calif., revenue bonds at a true interest cost of 5.2555 percent.</p>
</text>
